HERO SECTION – AI-DRIVEN PROCUREMENT

Title:
AI-Driven Procurement with Complete Transparency

Description:
ODIN redesigns the procure-to-pay (P2P) process to be agile, auditable, and fully traceable.

Key Points:
- AI-driven internal and external sourcing
- 100% traceable decisions and approvals
- Real-time leadership visibility

Internal Sourcing Steps:
1. Internal Requisition
2. Expiry Optimization
3. Central Stock
4. Store Issue

External Sourcing Steps:
1. RFQ
2. PO
2. GRN
4. Invoice
5. Payment